{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*Note: This demo has been designed and tested only on Windows 10, other operating systems may have problems. *</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Follow my voice. Trust my guidance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to see our god? My friend, you\u2019ve come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">I am merely a messenger, and I invite you to step onto the path of salvation. Just follow my lead. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of your journey, <strong>our gracious god will be waiting\u2014behind The Window 8.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ202534-18031.gif?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this show, you are no longer the bystanders, you are the star!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ20250327-212323.png?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Oh, as a welcome gift, we have prepared a little gift for you. The game we all like - Click the Stone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(<strong>Note: There are no casualties in this game</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will like it. You have to like it. After all, no one will welcome you like us. No one will treat you like a family member.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/\u5e8f\u5217_01_1.gif?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And we also have a little dinosaur. It runs and runs and runs...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ignore that last part. It\u2019s just a bug in the program. Nothing more. Nothing... intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/\u5f02\u53d8\u6e38\u620f.png?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Of course, as a member of our team, you also need to complete some tasks, such as finding out the ghosts in the photos.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry, our group will provide reliable props for new members. And there will be absolutely no bloody things in the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/\u5e8f\u5217_01_1.gif?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/b7a606b2778451940af590489583299f.png?t=1749433657\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296450?t=1749433657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296450?t=1749433657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/784ba286812ee6a8d80f73703e44fab955e9d54c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749433657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/784ba286812ee6a8d80f73703e44fab955e9d54c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749433657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3591310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*Note: This demo has been designed and tested only on Windows 10, other operating systems may have problems. *</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Follow my voice. Trust my guidance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to see our god? My friend, you\u2019ve come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">I am merely a messenger, and I invite you to step onto the path of salvation. Just follow my lead. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of your journey, <strong>our gracious god will be waiting\u2014behind The Window 8.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ202534-18031.gif?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In this show, you are no longer the bystanders, you are the star!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ20250327-212323.png?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Oh, as a welcome gift, we have prepared a little gift for you. The game we all like - Click the Stone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(<strong>Note: There are no casualties in this game</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will like it. You have to like it. After all, no one will welcome you like us. No one will treat you like a family member.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/\u5e8f\u5217_01_1.gif?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And we also have a little dinosaur. It runs and runs and runs...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ignore that last part. It\u2019s just a bug in the program. Nothing more. Nothing... intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/\u5f02\u53d8\u6e38\u620f.png?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Of course, as a member of our team, you also need to complete some tasks, such as finding out the ghosts in the photos.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry, our group will provide reliable props for new members. And there will be absolutely no bloody things in the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/\u5e8f\u5217_01_1.gif?t=1749433657\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/b7a606b2778451940af590489583299f.png?t=1749433657\" /></p>","developers":["MonsterMoonLight"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/1ff31a77982f575a69716265e11b040a4360914c/header.jpg?t=1749433657","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257150430,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150430/movie480.mp4?t=1748961796","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150430/movie_max.mp4?t=1748961796"},"name":"PV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150430/8cfefa87ff6d94f296e31e29bfa32b8006240f73/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748961796","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150430/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748961796","max":"http://video.